   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Inflate\n\nA flat sliver puffs up like a balloon toy, squashes and settles into a glossy mark, then the wordmark slides out. The mark is a fixed rounded square with a dot; the wordmark is the text variable.\n\nCategory: logo-stings. Length: 2.2 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A consumer, kids or casual app wants a soft, bouncy brand moment with a toy-like feel.\n- You have a wordmark and want the sting to supply a simple rounded mark beside it.\n\nAvoid when:\n- Your real logo must appear exactly as designed: the mark here is a fixed rounded square with a dot, so wrap your logo with spotlight or orbit-lock.\n- The brand is serious or premium and the bounce reads as too playful: use anamorphic-flare.\n\nVariables:\n- text (string): Wordmark, default \"studio\"\n- background_color (color): Background, default \"#111111\"\n- color (color): Body, default \"#E5322D\"\n- highlight (color): Highlight, default \"#FFFFFF\"\n- dot_color (color): Dot, default \"#111111\"\n- speed (number, 0.25-3): Speed, default 1\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
  {
